{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 2711,
	"Name": "Ace's Expanded Farms MTN",
	"Author": "acerbicon",
	"Description": "[center][b][size=4]Ace's Expanded Farms MTN[/size][/b]\n<br />[size=2]Brand new, fully functional farms. The new farms come with anything from mining[/size]\n<br />[size=2]areas and\u00A0extra farming space to new ponds and\u00A0waterfalls.\u00A0There’s\u00A0something[/size]\n<br />[size=2]for every taste.\u00A0Plus, after a trip to the pet store, your\u00A0pets now have a more[/size]\n<br />[size=2]comfortable living area.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=2]Choose the farms\u00A0[/size]you\u00A0[size=2]want, for every farm type, mix and match to make\u00A0\n<br />your farm fit you.\n<br />\n<br />If you want instructions on how to use on an old save rather than a new game[/size]\n<br />[size=2]look [/size][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/articles/90]here[/url][size=2]\uFEFF.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]REQUIREMENTS:[/b][b]\u00A0[/b][/size]\n<br />[url=http://www.smapi.io/]SMAPI[/url][size=2]\uFEFF[/size]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url][size=2]\uFEFF[/size]\n<br />[size=2][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2256]MTN (More Than Necessary)[/url]\uFEFF[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1140/?]\n<br />[/url][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]HOW TO INSTALL:[/b][/size]\n<br />1[size=2]. Download \"Ace Expanded Farms MTN\"\u00A0zip file.\n<br />2. Unzip into the \"Mods\" folder.\n<br />3. Play the game and enjoy your brand new farms![/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=4]EXTRA NOTES:[/size][/b]\n<br />[size=2]- Do you use Extended Minecart to get the most out of the new minecart on your farm?[/size]\n<br />[size=2]Make sure the following options are in your config file:[/size]\n<br />\u00A0 \"AlternateFarmMinecart\": false,\n<br />\u00A0 \"FarmDestinationEnabled\": false,\n<br />\u00A0 \"UseCustomFarmDestination\": true,\n<br />\u00A0 \"CustomFarmDestinationPoint\": \"79, 14\"\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=2]-Are you on an old save and having trouble with bushes being in the way? Download and\n<br />use this mod to reset them:\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2364?tab=files]BushReset[/url]\uFEFF in the optional files of\u00A0[/size][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2364]Even More Secret Woods[/url]\uFEFF.[/b][size=2][b]\n<br />[/b]\n<br />- Be ABSOLUTELY SURE to keep a back up of your save games.\u00A0ALWAYS make backups.\n<br />[b]\n<br />- For Robin to build on new farm areas, you must scroll right or down depending on the map.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />- If using a map recolor, download the compatibility patch for your recolor and my mod.\n<br />[b]\n<br />-\u00A0 For quarries included in these farms to work properly, you must use the\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/674]Mining at the Farm[/url]\uFEFF until \n<br />MTN\u00A0is updated to allow for it to be set up per map.\n<br />\n<br />[/b][/size]- Having issues with 2Cute Farm Cave? [url=https://community.playstarbound.com/threads/2cute-farmcave-w-legend-of-zelda-like-fairy-hotspring-also-an-underground-library-update-7-19.117897/page-5#post-3317702]Go here[/url]\uFEFF.[/center]",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2711",
